# MealKit table (BodyKind). Edit it in the editor's [Tables] panel or import a CSV there.
@format table 1

row normal
speedScale 1
massScale 1
movement Capsule

row light
speedScale 1.15
massScale 0.75
movement Kinematic

row heavy
speedScale 0.85
massScale 1.5
movement Floating

row ragdoll
speedScale 0.9
massScale 1
movement Ragdoll
